{
  "//": [
    "MageRide edge route table (C008). One entry per public path family in backend/contracts/*.yaml.",
    "",
    "Ordering — lower Order wins. Three tiers, because six path families are literal-vs-template",
    "overlaps and two of them cross a service boundary (C007 handoff):",
    "  10  cross-service literal overrides, e.g. /v1/rides/job-board (dispatch-svc) under the",
    "      /v1/rides prefix that otherwise belongs to ride-svc.",
    "  20  /v1/admin sub-trees owned by a service other than admin-bff.",
    "  50  ordinary per-service prefixes.",
    "  90  the admin-bff catch-all, which must be last or it swallows tier 20.",
    "",
    "AuthorizationPolicy is 'anonymous' on every route on purpose: the gateway does not authorize.",
    "AL-06 deny-by-default lives in the services, which are the only place the caller's effective",
    "role set and the target resource are both known. Leaving it unset would apply the kernel's",
    "fallback policy and 401 every public endpoint at the edge.",
    "",
    "/v1/internal/** appears in the contracts but in no route here: it is mTLS-only (D3' §0) and is",
    "refused ahead of routing by BlockedPathMiddleware.",
    "",
    "/v1/version/check is served by the gateway itself (VersionCheckEndpoints), so it has no route:",
    "a client below the D-31 floor could not reach a separate service through the gate rejecting it."
  ],

  "ReverseProxy": {

    "Routes": {

